      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这段时间你用了不少学习工具。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，词典、录音、视频课，还有中文输入法。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "哪个对你最有帮助？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我觉得录音和短对话最有用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "为什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "因为我能听、说，再马上比较。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那手机词典呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "也有用，但是我现在不会每个词都查。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好，工具应该帮你学习，不是打断学习。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前常常花很多时间找“最好”的应用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "现在我只留几个真正会用的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样手机也不会太乱。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且我更清楚自己的学习目标。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "技术最有用的时候，就是让简单的事情更简单。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不是让学习变得更复杂。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对。下一步可以把中文用到更多真实生活里。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc030_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，周末出去的时候我就开始试。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
